  "acceptance_criteria": [
    "ISSUE-0973 is closed with runtime, signature and verifiable digests.",
    "RUNTIME_REQUIREMENTS, SIGNATURE and ABI_SMOKE are PASS, and OCI, SBOM and provenance digests are present.",
    "Executor, QA and Reviewer have authentic attestations with verifiable functional segregation bound to the same TaskEnvelope, canonical digest and candidate SHA; solo mode preserves the real identity and accountable subject and requires PERSONAL_INDEPENDENCE=ABSENT_DECLARED.",
    "The ADR-059 authority validates attestations under signed policy, resolves the regime from governed trust and accepts no fallback.",
    "The gate record identifies candidate SHA, image digest, SBOM digest, provenance digest, signature reference and source-lock digest.",
    "The authentic Project Owner formal decision is exactly PASS or NO_GO; PASS requires the valid functional chain, NO_GO yields FAIL and absence remains fail-closed.",
    "Historical EPIC-092 residual criteria are only eligible for reevaluation after a PASS decision and the historical epic is not modified or reopened."
  ],
  "tests": [
    "python -m jsonschema -i .codex/tasks/operations/TASK-0764.json .codex/tasks/TASK_ENVELOPE.schema.json",
    "pytest -q -p no:cacheprovider tests/security/delivery_approval_authority/test_operational_verifier.py",
    "pytest -q -p no:cacheprovider tests/fnd/governanca-de-decisoes-arquiteturais-e-manutencao-da-b/test_delivery_approval_authority_contract.py",
    "Verify focused fail-closed outcomes for unauthorized governance mode, absent Owner decision, NO_GO, session/key reuse, sequence or predecessor mismatch, candidate mismatch, TaskEnvelope digest mismatch, unauthorized signer and binding scope mismatch."
  ],
  "evidence": [
    "evidence/implementation/issue-0974/owner-decision-package.json",
